\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Định hướng sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong từng BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YWd1dsUwQoILZ1xijNxlMAK4gNP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G329dRKrdoXJBtxdtUPlH4Kzgqb\"><strong>[BODY 1]</strong>: <strong>nh&oacute;m 18-35</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OKiLdSbJrometOxLF9VlFeCygvd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>số liệu ban đầu</strong> của nh&oacute;m 18-35 <em>(hơn 2,000)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UWJ2dJhTaorbqBxXZbRlg1Ctg4f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) <strong>Xu hướng thay đổi của nh&oacute;m 18-35 trong 20 năm đầu</strong> <em>(tăng đến 4,000 v&agrave;o năm 1975, trở về mức ban đầu v&agrave;o năm 1990).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QeEOdY8MRocpUixmxDblRANtgCg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) <strong>Xu hướng thay đổi của nh&oacute;m 18-35 trong những c&ograve;n lại</strong> <em>(tăng đến 5,000 v&agrave;o năm 1995, giảm xuống 4,000 v&agrave;o năm cuối)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EbkydzRqPouI6pxWs9hl2Y1XgPd\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EeiNd8hckogSthxrar1lFDGqgLf\"><strong>[BODY 2]</strong>: <strong>hai nh&oacute;m tuổi c&ograve;n lại</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R3sfdyoaZoDxpcxTkJ6lg9BBgPN\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm đầu </strong>của nh&oacute;m under 18 <em>(1,000)</em> v&agrave; nh&oacute;m 36-65 trở l&ecirc;n <em>(~500)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TMutdOnMYogrlPxFyIglW9Nbg0f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) <strong>Xu hướng thay đổi của nh&oacute;m under 18</strong> <em>(tăng đến 2,800 v&agrave;o năm 1990, đạt đỉnh 3,500 v&agrave;o năm cuối).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UnP5ddNFloMGYPxejFflZJKLgcc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) <strong>Xu hướng thay đổi của nh&oacute;m 36-65 </strong><em>(tăng từ từ đến 2,700 v&agrave;o năm cuối).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Định hướng về cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&aacute;c bạn c&oacute; thể tham khảo cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u sau đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\n<table class=\"ace-table\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"170;208;345\"><colgroup><col width=\"170\"><col width=\"208\"><col width=\"345\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZDkdZ7yCo3suyxr8YmlVFv6g2i\"><strong>Chức năng</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SYJpdnu4moIMPgxNtJDlw4y1gHg\"><strong>Cấu tr&uacute;c</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DkPMd824mocOBvxIheMlfB7tgJb\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L7bWd861uojQnFxhRqjlPQe3gCe\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu với </strong>\"<strong>number</strong>\"</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OmIBd5eFno7vCuxj2dCl1hOPgNh\">number (v) + X</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LsjMd9eoyoVOqYxPopTlKmggg3f\">With regard to individuals in the 18-35 age group, its members <strong>numbered</strong> just over 2,000 in 1970</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zw4Cdm1nSoNsFbxiqQulHMRqgkh\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả điểm cao nhất</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VEqyd46XuoP4qexxcpUlT3j0gsg\">a peak/ high of + X</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UbzydVlS6oVwFXxjwaXldoWqg8f\">This was followed by another larger surge <strong>to a peak</strong> of 5000 members in 1995, before declining again to 4,000 five years later.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LgkDdPGpjo1nVPxH4qzlsIGOg6d\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng dao động</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BLBtd9LQUo8FyexVN88lLIWNgrf\">To vary from X to Y</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qfmsdz4pro3h0fx09hElGTIugig\">&nbsp;</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CmmWdK1N9oyoj4xYF4alb3K6gxh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The number of gym members under 18 <strong>varied over the following 2 decades, from approximately 1,800 to 2,800.</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
